{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_40_132634546#0_321962125","relevance":3,"reason":"This article is dedicated to the importance of diversity in nursing and explicitly lists impacts such as better population representation, increased patient comfort, benefits for nurses, and improved patient care.","learned":"Diversity/EDI impacts nursing by making the workforce more representative, increasing patient comfort, benefiting nurses, and improving patient care."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q1421","reason":"This query produced a directly relevant document about diversity impacts in nursing; continue for additional sources on patient care, outcomes, health equity, and cultural competence."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q1421"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_40_132634546#2_321965088","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q1421","rank":2,"snippet":"the population. 2. Diversity increases comfort levels for patients. 3. Nurses benefit from diversity. 4. Diversity improves patient care. \" , \"segment\": \"Because our patients are becoming increasingly more diverse, nurses who are also diverse and caring for patients is a major benefit. Nurses who understand an individual patient's background, culture and experiences on a personal level increases that patient's comfort level considerably. 3. Nurses benefit from diversity. All nurses benefit when employers make diversity a priority. Nurses are ensured fair access to open positions, promotions and other employment benefits when diversity is valued, but they are also able to seek support from other nurses who share their culture, ethnicity or other characteristics. A more diverse team can do better things for patients and doctors alike. With different backgrounds and views, your team can better evaluate and diagnose patients, which leads to a better learning environment. 4. Diversity improves <cover>patient care.\" , \"start_char\": 1040.000000 , \"title\": \"The Importance of Diversity in Nursing | </cover>Fastaff Travel Nursing\" , \"url\": \"https://www.fastaff.com/blog/importance-diversity-nursing\" }"}}
