{"request":{"op":"query","query":"(^ nursing (+ \"diversity equity inclusion\" \"diversity and inclusion\" inclusion) (+ retention belonging burnout \"work environment\" \"job satisfaction\"))"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_48_1142529924#23_2062399616","ok":true,"op":"query","qid":"q1428","rank":1,"snippet":"Employee Engagement Creating a Healthy Work Environment for Nurses Providing Authentic Leadership Applying Transformational Leadership Discussion Implications for Nurse Leaders Conclusions References Biography Article Info Publication History Identification Copyright ScienceDirect Figures Tables \" , \"segment\": \"Databases sources. Databases searched included Cumulative Index to Nursing and Allied Health Literature (CINAHL), MEDLINE via PubMed, PsycINFO, and Google Scholar. Search terms, phrases, and subject headings were selected based on the purpose of the review and inclusion criteria. The following search terms were used: (“ burnout, psychological” [MeSH Terms] OR “<cover>burnout” [tiab]) AND (“leadership” [MeSH Terms] OR “leadership” [tiab]) AND (“Nurses” [mh] OR “Nursing” [mh] OR nurse [tiab] OR nurses [tiab] OR nursing [tiab]). Inclusion </cover>and exclusion. To be included, the studies had to be primary research data-based and to have reported the relationships between nurse leadership and burnout. To evaluate the latest evidence, the studies should be conducted in the la\" , \"start_char\": 9233.000000 , \"title\": \"The Impact of Nurse Leadership Styles on Nurse Burnout: - Nurse Leader\" , \"url\": \"https://www.nurseleader.com/article/S1541-4612(20)30092-6/fulltext\" }"}}
